{"type":"message","id":"d2aa5ef3","parentId":"8e7f56bc","timestamp":"2026-04-03T07:43:30.231Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"It seems exec is completely blocked by security policy. I need to inform the user about this limitation.","thinkingSignature":"68b6d9336bb0659abfe1cb9815b2b62f8585b8afcbe283ff78150e66a34ec9d6"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] ⚠️ **exec 权限被安全策略拦截**，无法启动 dashboard。\n\n这是因为我当前运行环境的 exec 安全模式配置为 `deny` 或 `allowlist`，而常用的 shell 命令（`lsof`, `git`, `npm` 等）未被加入白名单。\n\n**解决方案：**\n1. 如果你有服务器的 SSH 权限，可以手动运行以下命令启动：\n   ```bash\n   # 停止旧服务\n   lsof -ti:3000 | xargs kill -9 2>/dev/null\n   \n   # 下载项目（如需要）\n   mkdir -p ~/projects\n   cd ~/projects\n   git clone https://github.com/xmanrui/OpenClaw-bot-review.git 2>/dev/null || (cd OpenClaw-bot-review && git pull)\n   \n   # 安装依赖并启动\n   cd ~/projects/OpenClaw-bot-review\n   npm install\n   npm run dev &\n   ```\n\n2. 或者请管理员在 OpenClaw 配置中允许 exec 权限。\n\n需要我帮你生成完整的启动脚本吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":3846,"output":242,"cacheRead":12321,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16409,"cost":{"input":0.0011538,"output":0.0002904,"cacheRead":0.0007392599999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00218346}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775202201659,"responseId":"061ea299eb868768e79ddd4194b0f548"}}
