{"type":"message","id":"ecbddd58","parentId":"b5f0f1d8","timestamp":"2026-04-03T07:56:38.626Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The logs show GET / 200 successful responses. So the server IS serving the page correctly.\n\nThe \"Cannot GET /\" error the user is seeing might be:\n1. A browser caching issue\n2. They might be seeing an old cached version\n3. The SSH tunnel might have some issue\n\nActually wait - the user said they ran `ssh -L 3000:localhost:3000 ubuntu@vm` and got \"Cannot GET /\". But that exact error message \"Cannot GET /\" sounds like an Express.js error message, not a Next.js/Next error.\n\nThis could mean there's something else running on that port, or the tunnel is not correctly set up.\n\nLet me verify the dashboard is still running and responding properly.","thinkingSignature":"7be3c5221d8d5d34d8996fa20888a30880dd9548d6693dd30f8c8a61bddaa5f2"},{"type":"text","text":"服务端日志显示 `GET / 200` 是正常的。问题可能是：\n\n1. **SSH 隧道命令格式问题** — 你用的是 `ssh -L 3000:localhost:3000 ubuntu@vm...`，正确的格式应该是：\n   ```\n   ssh -L 3000:172.18.0.2:3000 ubuntu@你的服务器IP\n   ```\n   或者如果 dashboard 监听在 localhost：\n   ```\n   ssh -L 3000:localhost:3000 ubuntu@你的服务器IP\n   ```\n\n2. **浏览器缓存** — 试试强制刷新 `Ctrl+Shift+R` 或清除缓存后重试\n\n3. **确认隧道端口对应正确** — 本地 3000 → 远程 3000\n\n你能告诉我完整的 SSH 命令或者服务器 IP 是什么样的吗？我帮你确认下隧道是否正确。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":17645,"output":327,"cacheRead":12321,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":30293,"cost":{"input":0.0052935,"output":0.0003924,"cacheRead":0.0007392599999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00642516}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775202986340,"responseId":"061ea5aa65e015c8d3c399ce45125bbe"}}
{"type":"message","id":"f9115566","parentId":"ecbddd58","timestamp":"2026-04-03T07:59:03.853Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53c37af310a8eeab09370a1b0da\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_8d379606db2e0a64b8dbda39b4671fa6\",\n  \"sender\": \"听风\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Fri 2026-04-03 07:59 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"听风 (ou_8d379606db2e0a64b8dbda39b4671fa6)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_8d379606db2e0a64b8dbda39b4671fa6\",\n  \"name\": \"听风\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b53c37af310a8eeab09370a1b0da]\n听风: ssh -L 3000:localhost:3000 ubuntu@vm-0-14-ubuntu"}],"timestamp":1775203143836}}
{"type":"message","id":"0a4bf0b5","parentId":"f9115566","timestamp":"2026-04-03T07:59:34.904Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is using `ssh -L 3000:localhost:3000 ubuntu@vm-0-14-ubuntu`. This means they're tunneling from their local machine to the remote server, where the dashboard is running on localhost:3000.\n\nThe issue is that when they do `ssh -L 3000:localhost:3000`, it connects local port 3000 to remote localhost:3000. But this only works if the SSH connection is to the server where the dashboard is running.\n\nLooking at the setup:\n- Dashboard is running on the server at localhost:3000\n- User is SSH'ing to ubuntu@vm-0-14-ubuntu\n- They want to access localhost:3000 on the server from their local browser\n\nThis command looks correct. The issue might be:\n1. The SSH connection might not be established properly\n2. The server might not be reachable at vm-0-14-ubuntu\n3. There might be a different issue with the DNS resolution of vm-0-14-ubuntu\n\nBut wait - the user got \"Cannot GET /\" which is a valid HTTP error from something. It means they connected to something but it returned a 404 or similar. This could be:\n1. Another service running on port 3000 on the server\n2. The SSH tunnel is connecting to a different port 3000 on the server\n\nActually, thinking more carefully - the command `ssh -L 3000:localhost:3000 ubuntu@vm-0-14-ubuntu` means:\n- Local port 3000 is forwarded to the remote server\n- On the remote server, it connects to localhost:3000\n- So if the dashboard is running on the server's localhost:3000, this should work\n\nThe \"Cannot GET /\" error suggests something IS responding on the other end, but it's not the dashboard or it can't find the route.\n\nWait - could it be that the SSH connection itself is failing and they're hitting some other service? Or maybe the server has a firewall or something else running on port 3000?\n\n\nI should ask them to verify a few things: whether the SSH connection is actually established, if the dashboard is truly running on that server, and what vm-0-14-ubuntu resolves to. I could also suggest trying a simple curl test to see if the tunnel itself is working properly.","thinkingSignature":"08d12836c0bd34e31ccac6cf029ede355c31cb62258ffcb303b6cd52b53b1c95"},{"type":"text","text":"命令看起来是对的。不过 `Cannot GET /` 说明有东西响应了，只是找不到页面。\n\n可能的原因：\n\n1. **Dashboard 还没完全启动** — 首次访问需要编译，等几秒再试\n\n2. **服务器上可能有其他服务占用了 3000 端口** — 在服务器上检查一下：\n   ```bash\n   curl http://localhost:3000\n   ```\n\n3. **SSH 隧道没有成功建立** — 确认隧道处于活跃状态\n\n**你能先在本地测试下吗？**\n按顺序执行：\n\n```bash\n# 1. 先确认 SSH 隧道连接着（不要关闭终端）\n\n# 2. 在另一个终端，本地执行：\ncurl http://localhost:3000\n```\n\n如果返回 HTML 内容，说明隧道正常，是浏览器缓存问题。如果返回 `Connection refused`，说明隧道没通。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":39,"output":662,"cacheRead":17477,"cacheWrite":12316,"totalTokens":30494,"cost":{"input":0.0000117,"output":0.0007944,"cacheRead":0.0010486199999999999,"cacheWrite":0.0046185,"total":0.00647322}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775203143851,"responseId":"061ea64854a36c1a6923a9d46e587ed7"}}
{"type":"message","id":"751beeba","parentId":"0a4bf0b5","timestamp":"2026-04-03T07:59:45.246Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53c3781a04a4ee8262f5578b7d4\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_8d379606db2e0a64b8dbda39b4671fa6\",\n  \"sender\": \"听风\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Fri 2026-04-03 07:59 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"听风 (ou_8d379606db2e0a64b8dbda39b4671fa6)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_8d379606db2e0a64b8dbda39b4671fa6\",\n  \"name\": \"听风\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b53c3781a04a4ee8262f5578b7d4]\n听风: 是不是3000端口被占用的原因哦，之前我自己运行这个项目的时候有提示端口占用"}],"timestamp":1775203185229}}
