{"type":"message","id":"a73ea7c1","parentId":"c32093c1","timestamp":"2026-04-03T08:05:03.590Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking about the port 3000 issue. I found that port 3000 IS working - the server responds with HTML. But the user is getting \"Cannot GET /\" error when accessing through SSH tunnel.\n\nThe user now also sent `/task list` which seems to be a command. Let me respond to both.\n\nActually, looking at the conversation flow - I did respond to the port question in my previous message (the one with the HTML output showing the server IS working). But the user said \"这个问题怎么不回复\" - why didn't you answer this question? \n\nWait, looking at my previous response - I did answer but maybe the format wasn't clear. The server IS running fine on port 3000. The issue is likely with the SSH tunnel not working correctly, OR there's something else going on.\n\nLet me address the task list command and the port issue.","thinkingSignature":"cccd993b9d33d050b8f9f39bb3e14803d5fc05c02070a1c9a4301c1120471d55"},{"type":"text","text":"\n抱歉！刚才那条消息其实我已经回复了（服务端 curl 测试显示 3000 端口正常），可能你没看到。\n\n**关于端口占用：** 我刚才在服务器上检查了，curl http://localhost:3000 返回了正常的 HTML，说明**当前 3000 端口没有被占用，而且 Dashboard 运行正常**。\n\n所以问题不在端口占用，而可能是：\n1. **SSH 隧道本身没通** — 你本地 3000 端口没有成功映射到服务器\n2. **浏览器缓存** — 试试用隐身模式打开 http://localhost:3000\n\n---\n\n至于 `/task list` — 这个命令我目前不支持，我没有任务管理功能。如果你想要任务管理看板，可以继续用 Bot Review Dashboard（如果 SSH 隧道能通的话）。\n\n需要我帮你诊断 SSH 隧道问题吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":39,"output":345,"cacheRead":42056,"cacheWrite":434,"totalTokens":42874,"cost":{"input":0.0000117,"output":0.000414,"cacheRead":0.0025233599999999997,"cacheWrite":0.00016275,"total":0.00311181}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775203480963,"responseId":"061ea79940b5ea4e11e36174757ce3eb"}}
