{"type":"message","id":"2fdf04d6","parentId":"a014e7c4","timestamp":"2026-04-03T08:12:06.640Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting - this sandbox doesn't have SSH server running on localhost:22. But that's expected since we're running in a container.\n\nThe user is connecting from their LOCAL COMPUTER to `ubuntu@vm-0-14-ubuntu`. So the SSH connection is from the user's machine to the server.\n\nLet me think about what the actual issue could be:\n\n1. User runs `ssh -L 3000:localhost:3000 ubuntu@vm-0-14-ubuntu`\n2. This creates a tunnel from user's local 3000 to server's localhost:3000\n3. User accesses http://localhost:3000 in their browser\n4. They get \"Cannot GET /\"\n\nThe server's dashboard IS running and returning proper HTML. But the user is getting 404 \"Cannot GET /\".\n\nWait - maybe the issue is that the user has another process on their LOCAL machine using port 3000, and the tunnel isn't being established properly. Or the SSH connection is failing silently.\n\nOr... maybe the user is seeing a cached 404 from a previous failed attempt. They should:\n1. Close the SSH tunnel\n2. Make sure nothing is running on local port 3000\n3. Create a FRESH SSH tunnel\n4. Try again with a hard refresh\n\nLet me explain to the user what I've verified and suggest troubleshooting steps.","thinkingSignature":"2c6d00b9f053ab38c7794880bc01786610a43339a9fd823e0f55c5107bfb0f13"},{"type":"text","text":"根据我的检查：\n\n**服务器端状态（一切正常）：**\n- Dashboard 监听 `localhost:3000` 和 `172.18.0.2:3000` ✅\n- curl http://localhost:3000 返回完整 HTML ✅\n- 进程 running ✅\n\n**可能的问题原因：**\n\n1. **SSH 隧道没有成功建立** — 你的 SSH 连接可能断了或者没有真正打通\n2. **本地 3000 端口被其他程序占用** — 导致隧道映射到了错误的地方\n3. **浏览器缓存了之前的错误响应** — 404 被缓存了\n\n**请按顺序尝试：**\n\n```bash\n# 1. 先断开现有 SSH 连接\n\n# 2. 在本地检查 3000 端口是否被占用\n# macOS:\nlsof -i :3000\n# Windows:\nnetstat -ano | findstr :3000\n\n# 3. 确认没有占用后，重新建立隧道\nssh -L 3000:localhost:3000 ubuntu@vm-0-14-ubuntu\n\n# 4. 在浏览器打开（最好用隐身模式）\nhttp://localhost:3000\n```\n\n如果还是不行，告诉我：\n- 第 2 步检查本地 3000 端口的结果\n- SSH 隧道建立时有没有报错信息"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":31908,"output":547,"cacheRead":12321,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":44776,"cost":{"input":0.0095724,"output":0.0006564,"cacheRead":0.0007392599999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01096806}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775203905320,"responseId":"061ea941ec15f402ca9851d5f6d89166"}}
{"type":"message","id":"1f19ddac","parentId":"2fdf04d6","timestamp":"2026-04-03T08:13:59.557Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53c32289b134eeaaa1bea341e94\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_8d379606db2e0a64b8dbda39b4671fa6\",\n  \"sender\": \"听风\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Fri 2026-04-03 08:13 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"听风 (ou_8d379606db2e0a64b8dbda39b4671fa6)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_8d379606db2e0a64b8dbda39b4671fa6\",\n  \"name\": \"听风\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b53c32289b134eeaaa1bea341e94]\n听风: blocklee@Mac ~ % lsof -i :3000\nCOMMAND     PID     USER   FD   TYPE             DEVICE SIZE/OFF NODE NAME\nGoogle    31485 blocklee   50u  IPv6 0xff0a6d7f4e119155      0t0  TCP localhost:54309->localhost:hbci (CLOSE_WAIT)\nGoogle    31485 blocklee   51u  IPv6 0xff0a6d7f4f4c7955      0t0  TCP localhost:54310->localhost:hbci (ESTABLISHED)\nssh       42572 blocklee    7u  IPv6 0xff0a6d7f4e128955      0t0  TCP localhost:hbci (LISTEN)\nssh       42572 blocklee    8u  IPv4 0xff0a6d7a8de3d6ad      0t0  TCP localhost:hbci (LISTEN)\nssh       42572 blocklee   13u  IPv6 0xff0a6d7f4f4d2155      0t0  TCP localhost:hbci->localhost:54310 (ESTABLISHED)\nblocklee@Mac ~ %"}],"timestamp":1775204039539}}
