{"type":"message","id":"f14a28da","parentId":"a889293a","timestamp":"2026-04-03T08:26:25.735Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Server is returning the correct Next.js HTML on port 3000. So the server is fine.\n\nThe problem must be with the SSH tunnel. Let me try a different approach - maybe we should use a different port for the tunnel or the IP address on the server side.\n\nActually, let me think about this differently. The user is tunneling to `localhost:3000` on the remote side. But what if there's an old process still bound to that port and it's taking precedence? When the user runs `curl http://localhost:3001` on their Mac, the SSH tunnel forwards to the server's `localhost:3000`. But what if something else is listening on the server's localhost:3000 instead of the Next.js?\n\nWait - I just realized something. Looking at my initial curl tests from the server, they all worked fine. But when the user tunnels and curls localhost:3001, they get \"Cannot GET /\". \n\nThis could be because:\n1. The SSH tunnel isn't actually forwarding to the Next.js app correctly\n2. There's something with IPv4/IPv6 resolution\n\nLet me suggest the user try the Tailscale IP instead of the hostname, or try using `127.0.0.1` explicitly in the tunnel.\n\nActually, wait - the user should also try running curl directly on the server to double-check that localhost:3000 still works.","thinkingSignature":"a1c69be4bcbb967b0b139ec9c9d8778604bd309ac2194c9488bfa407827b7b32"},{"type":"text","text":"服务器上 curl 正常！说明 Next.js 服务是好的。\n\n问题一定在 **SSH 隧道** 上。让我帮你试试另一个方法——用服务器的内网 IP 来建立隧道：\n\n**请在你的 Mac 上重新建立隧道，使用这个命令：**\n\n```bash\nssh -L 3001:127.0.0.1:3000 ubuntu@vm-0-14-ubuntu\n```\n\n注意我把 `localhost` 改成了 `127.0.0.1`。\n\n然后再试试：\n```bash\ncurl -s http://localhost:3001 | head -5\n```\n\n如果还是不行，试一下直接用 Tailscale IP（从服务器信息看是 `100.93.115.18`）：\n```bash\nssh -L 3001:100.93.115.18:3000 ubuntu@vm-0-14-ubuntu\n```"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":57048,"output":465,"cacheRead":12321,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":69834,"cost":{"input":0.0171144,"output":0.000558,"cacheRead":0.0007392599999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.018411659999999996}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775204761373,"responseId":"061eac99e3b292b5cc1ae7ce1fecd8b2"}}
