{"type":"message","id":"d048d2d4","parentId":"4b1d8056","timestamp":"2026-04-03T08:39:30.959Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see the problem. There are some unusual characters (M-BM- which is UTF-8 for non-breaking spaces or similar) before `\"enabled\": true`. The line shows:\n```\nM-BM-  M-BM-  M-BM-  \"enabled\": true,\n```\n\nThese are likely `\\u00a0` (non-breaking space) characters that got into the JSON somehow. Let me clean this up by reading the full file and rewriting it properly.","thinkingSignature":"618fb7f4dfbc58830269d8386999ec32266881ff2c36d07293c4fb4bd19212a3"},{"type":"text","text":"找到问题了！JSON 文件里有非标准空白字符（\\u00a0 非中断空格）混入了 `\"agentToAgent\": {` 后面。\n\n让我修复它：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_2x453gxndka6_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 -c \"\nimport json\nwith open('/home/node/.openclaw/openclaw.json', 'r') as f:\n    content = f.read()\n\n# Remove non-breaking spaces and other unusual whitespace\nclean = content.replace('\\u00a0', ' ').replace('\\ufeff', '')\n\n# Write back\nwith open('/home/node/.openclaw/openclaw.json', 'w') as f:\n    f.write(clean)\n\n# Verify\njson.load(open('/home/node/.openclaw/openclaw.json'))\nprint('Fixed and verified!')\n\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":83699,"output":270,"cacheRead":12321,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":96290,"cost":{"input":0.0251097,"output":0.00032399999999999996,"cacheRead":0.0007392599999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.02617296}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775205561495,"responseId":"061eafba438b3389bef03c8ea5c1b566"}}
